    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(A)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(I)</td>\t\t\t<td>Amphoteric</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(B)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(II)</td>\t\t\t<td>Basic</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(C)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Al</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(III)</td>\t\t\t<td>Neutral</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(D)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(IV)</td>\t\t\t<td>Acidic</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
